   "quest": 608,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: You're not up to this mission. If we're to achieve victory, we must be patient. A good general waits patiently for the right time to strike! (Only a character who possesses Ketra's friend - 4th level can undertake this quest.)",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
