  "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-03.htm",
   "quest": 606,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Attack the garrison of the Varka Silenos and kill as many of them as possible! Cut off their Shillien Manes and bring them back as proof of your valor! Bring back 100 of them and I'll give you a reward! Tejakar Ketra!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-06.html",
   "quest": 606,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: The fight must go on! Victory is ours!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-07.html",
   "quest": 606,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Excellent! Today's victory will always be remembered! Oh, brave warrior! You'll be well-rewarded for your valor! At one time, this Buffalo horn was only given to the bravest soldiers of our tribe. It's quite valuable! You could trade it for something you really need!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I want to go back to the battlefield.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos 31370-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos",
     "event": "31370-06.html",
     "quest": 606,
     "to": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-06.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I have more manes.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos 31370-07.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos",
     "event": "31370-07.html",
     "quest": 606,
     "to": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-07.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-07.html",
      "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-08.html"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I want to quit.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos 31370-09.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos",
     "event": "31370-09.html",
     "quest": 606,
     "to": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-09.html",
     "effect": "end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-08.html",
   "quest": 606,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Didn't I ask for at least 100 Shillien Manes? Return to the battlefield now!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00606_BattleAgainstVarkaSilenos/31370-09.html",
   "quest": 606,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Even the most invincible warrior should take a break once in a while! You've done well! Come back when you're rested!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "exit": true
   },
   "outcome": "end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00607_ProveYourCourageKetra/31370-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00607_ProveYourCourageKetra/31370-04.htm",
   "quest": 607,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Among the Varka Silenos lurks an extremely skilled shaman known as Shadith. He leads their forces in battle far too successfully. He must be destroyed! But I must warn you, you can't take him down alone. Gather your trusted comrades, confront Shadith and take his head!",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00607_ProveYourCourageKetra/31370-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00607_ProveYourCourageKetra/31370-07.html",
   "quest": 607,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Excellent! The head of Shadith!? Ugly bastard, wasn't he? You've proven your courage. Please accept this Totem of Valor in recognition of your outstanding military achievements! It's the custom of the Ketra to give this to the our most respected soldier who has proved the true valor…",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00608_SlayTheEnemyCommanderKetra/31370-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00608_SlayTheEnemyCommanderKetra/31370-04.htm",
   "quest": 608,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Excellent! This mission is critical to the war effort. I need you to go to the garrison of the Varka Silenos and kill their commander! He's known as Mos, and he's the best swordsman in the entire tribe! Although you're an excellent fighter, don't even think of taking him on alone! G…",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00608_SlayTheEnemyCommanderKetra/31370-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00608_SlayTheEnemyCommanderKetra/31370-07.html",
   "quest": 608,
   "text": "Kadun Zu Ketra: Ha! Excellent! This is outstanding! Our war with the Varka Silenos has entered its final stage! The loss of their commander means that they can no longer resist our powerful forces! Good job! Please accept this totem of strategy as an acknowledgement of your service to the Ketra Orc…",
   "header": "Kadun Zu Ketra",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
